~ blocked
do disable_movement()
Stone and vine, stacked shoulder high across the gap. Someone piled this here on purpose.
You could shift it with an axe. You don't have one.
do enable_movement()
=> END

~ hint
do disable_movement()
Stone and vine, stacked shoulder high across the gap.
The vines are doing the holding. A few good swings of the axe should bring it down.
do enable_movement()
=> END

~ cleared
do disable_movement()
The pile comes apart easier than it looks. The vines were holding it together, not the stone.
do enable_movement()
=> END
